  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>n</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>And,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Form <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p>From&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;we get&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Variance, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>E</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Standard deviation, <math><mi>&#963;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math>.</p></blockquote>"
  }
